/ AGENDA EN RUBANS, nouvelle interface (Michael 2026-10-24, maquette validée) :
  le mois en semaines, chaque séjour en une bande qui court de l'après-midi de
  son arrivée au matin de son départ ; à droite, le jour choisi. Sur téléphone,
  la semaine en pastilles puis la liste des sept jours qui viennent. Données :
  `Agenda::Month` (bandes) et `Agenda::Day` (une journée). La vue Sourciers et
  l'ancienne interface gardent `pages/calendar`.
- agenda = @agenda
- month = agenda.month
- previous_month = month.prev_month
- next_month = month.next_month
div(data-controller="stay-details stay-merge agenda-filter" data-stay-merge-setup-url-value=merge_setup_stays_path data-stay-merge-preview-url-value=merge_preview_stays_path data-stay-merge-reset-value=params[:stay_merge_done].present?)
  header.ui-phead
    .ui-phead-t
      .ui-title-row
        h1.ui-h1 Agenda
        = render "guide/screen_links/header", title: "Agenda"
    .ui-actions
      - if section_writable?(:full)
        = link_to new_stay_path, class: "ui-btn ui-btn-p ui-hide-m" do
          = ui_icon(:plus, size: 16)
          | Nouveau séjour

  / ---- Ordinateur et tablette ------------------------------------------------
  .ui-ag-desk
    .ui-ag-bar
      .ui-ag-month
        = link_to root_path(date: previous_month.iso8601), class: "ui-ibtn ui-ibtn-o", aria: { label: "Mois précédent, #{l(previous_month, format: '%B %Y')}" } do
          = ui_icon(:left, size: 18)
        h2.ui-ag-title = l(month, format: "%B %Y").capitalize
        = link_to root_path(date: next_month.iso8601), class: "ui-ibtn ui-ibtn-o", aria: { label: "Mois suivant, #{l(next_month, format: '%B %Y')}" } do
          = ui_icon(:right, size: 18)
        = link_to "Aujourd’hui", root_path, class: "ui-btn ui-btn-s"
      = render "pages/v2/agenda_views", date: month

    .ui-ag-bar
      .ui-ag-filters(role="group" aria-label="Montrer")
        - [["all", "Tout", nil], ["lodging", "Hébergements", :bed], ["room", "Salles", :room], ["activity", "Activités", :compass], ["meal", "Repas", :utensils]].each do |kind, label, icon|
          button.ui-chip(type="button" data-kind=kind data-agenda-filter-target="button" data-action="agenda-filter#pick" aria-pressed=(kind == "all").to_s)
            - if icon
              = ui_icon(icon, size: 16)
            = label
      ul.ui-ag-legend(aria-label="Légende")
        li
          i.ui-rib-swatch.ui-rib-ok(aria-hidden="true")
          | Confirmé
        li
          i.ui-rib-swatch.ui-rib-pre(aria-hidden="true")
          | Pré-confirmé
        li
          i.ui-rib-swatch.ui-rib-wait(aria-hidden="true")
          | En attente

    .ui-ag-layout
      .ui-ag-main
        .ui-ag-grid(data-agenda-filter-target="grid" data-agenda-filter="all")
          - agenda.weeks.each do |week|
            = render "pages/v2/agenda_week", week: week, month: month, agenda: agenda
        p.ui-ag-note
          | Une bande commence l’après-midi de l’arrivée et finit le matin du départ : deux séjours qui se suivent partagent la même journée.
        - if section_writable?(:full)
          .ui-ag-merge
            = render "pages/calendar/merge_toolbar"

      aside.ui-ag-side(aria-label="Le jour choisi")
        = turbo_frame_tag "agenda_day" do
          = render "pages/v2/agenda_day", day: @agenda_day

  / ---- Téléphone ---------------------------------------------------------------
  .ui-ag-mob
    = render "pages/v2/agenda_views", date: month
    = render "pages/v2/agenda_strip", agenda: agenda
    - @agenda_week.each_with_index do |day, index|
      = render "pages/v2/agenda_list_day", day: day, first: index.zero?

  = render "pages/calendar/stay_modal"
  = render "stays/merge_dialog"
  = render "stays/merge_bottom_bar"
